            "review_title": "Review at Oscar Saigon Weekend Buffet",
            "review_text": "lois-zee\nSVL30 contributions\n0\nGreat Food, Great View.. Great People\nOct 2012 • Solo\nThis is a celebration restaurant! Vietnamese go for birthdays and anniversaries. I found it because everyone leaving seemed so happy. And I found they have have a good reason. The buffet has a mainstay of hot pot ..very fresh fish and veggies etc.. and fresh cooked to order shellfish.. and then an ever changing buffet of soups, salads, dim sum, entrees etc... and it is delicious. And no thirst from MSG hours later. It is great in the tourist area to be ble to b among locals celebrating... and its n the 11th floor with a wonderful view..\n\nCurrently it costs under $15!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 24, 2012",
